    ns1:latexDefinition "$m^* = \\hbar^2k(\\frac{d\\varepsilon}{dk})$, where $\\hbar$ is the reduced Planck constant, $k$ is the wavenumber, and $\\varepsilon$ is the energy of the electron."^^ns1:LatexString ;
