        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PER-MIN>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PER-MO>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PER-MilliSEC>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PER-SEC>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PER-WK>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/PER-YR>,
