    ns1:plainTextDescription "Electric energy is the energy transferred to or from an electrical circuit over time. It is the integral of electric power over time and is commonly measured in watt-hours (Wh) or kilowatt-hours (kWh)." ;
    ns1:symbol "E_e" ;
    ns1:wikidataMatch <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q206799> ;
