    ns1:latexDefinition "$F_m = \\oint \\mathbf{H} \\cdot dr$, where $\\mathbf{H}$ is magnetic field strength and $r$ is position vector along a given curve $C$ from point $a$ to point $b$."^^ns1:LatexString ;
