        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NanoGRAY-PER-SEC>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NanoSV-PER-HR>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NanoSV-PER-MIN>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/NanoSV-PER-SEC>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/REM-PER-SEC>,
