    dcterms:description """
  A $\\textit{Gigawatt Hour}$ is the 1,000,000,000-fold of the product of the SI derived unit watt and the unit hour.
  """^^ns1:LatexString ;
    ns1:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS>,
