| `AC-240VLL-208VLN-120VLN-1Ph-60Hz` |
| `AC-240VLL-208VLN-120VLN-3Ph-60Hz` |
| `AC-240VLN-1Ph-50Hz` |
| `AC-277VLN-1Ph-60Hz` |
| `AC-347VLN-1Ph-60Hz` |
| `AC-380VLL-1Ph-60Hz` |
