| `AC-380VLL-219VLN-1Ph-60Hz` |
| `AC-380VLL-219VLN-3Ph-60Hz` |
| `AC-400VLL-1Ph-50Hz` |
| `AC-400VLL-3Ph-50Hz` |
| `AC-400VLL-230VLN-1Ph-50Hz` |
